      "side": 1,
      "message": "I guess ToAPI is for native-\u003eC, not C++-\u003eC. C++-\u003eC would go in webgpu_cpp.h. Actually, webgpu_cpp.h already has implicit conversions:\n```\n    inline operator const WGPUBufferDescriptor\u0026() const noexcept;\n```\nThat would work with an explicit cast like `\u0026static_cast\u003cWGPUInstanceDescriptor\u0026\u003e(instanceDesc)` but but I\u0027m not sure if they can be used to do an implicit conversion from `wgpu::Descriptor*` to `WGPUDescriptor*` (behind a pointer). \n\nIf not, we should:\n- add something that does that implicit conversion if possible (probably not)\n- or add a named method on the C++ struct that casts it to C\n\nin order to avoid needing so many reinterpret_casts.",
